 behind 25% of your lost leads, 1.4\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the king's knight (51%), landing on d4, g4, e4.","Aim at their bishop: it is behind 23% of their lost leads, 1.4\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the light-squared bishop (54%). The reply wins it outright 11% of the time.","Material changes hands for you on d4 and e4: build pressure there.","They win material on f7 and a8: keep those squares defended.","Look for the zwischenzug: it appears 1.5\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"Sicilian Defense"}